{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21604","headline":"游三寺回呈上府主严司空时因寻寺道出当阳县奉命覆视县囚牵於游行不暇详究故以诗自诮尔 · 元稹","name":"游三寺回呈上府主严司空时因寻寺道出当阳县奉命覆视县囚牵於游行不暇详究故以诗自诮尔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢公恣纵颠狂掾，触处闲行许自由。\n举板支颐对山色，当筵吹帽落台头。\n贪缘稽首他方佛，无暇精心满县囚。\n莫责寻常吐茵吏，书囊赤白报君侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21604.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21604","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}